  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSB - Nansen Program Energy Sector Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Allocation to The Norwegian Directorate for Civil Protection (DSB) over the Ministry of Foreign Affairs&#x2019; budget, for tasks DSB is to manage related the Nansen Program for Ukraina and neighbouring countries, focusing on the Energy Sector in Moldova. Activities included feasibility studies carried out by an engineering team from Ramb&#xf8;ll AS for (a) a technical assessment of the possibilities for transferring a donated gas turbine from Norway to Moldova, and (b) the preparation of the associated cost estimates.</narrative>
  </description>
